<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Horsethief Meadows</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:201-2: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.336460" lon="-121.572910"><ele>1097.3</ele><name>Turnout on Highway 35 near Robinhood Campground</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:horsethief-meadows-turnout; confidence: high; pdf_page: 203; quote: a turnout on Highway 35 about 0.9 mile north on the highway from Pocket Creek Sno-Park near Robinhood Campground</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.335510" lon="-121.574530"><ele>1104.9</ele><name>Highway 35 / Road 3520 junction</name><desc>source: OSM way 978882480 (NF 3520) start at OR 35; confidence: high; pdf_page: 203; quote: Near here, Road 3520, a leg of Robinhood Creek Loop, goes northwest</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.343790" lon="-121.583480"><ele>1096.7</ele><name>Road 3520 / Road 620 junction</name><desc>source: OSM way 5039598 Forest Road 3520-620 start on NF 3520; 0.73 mi along 3520 (book 0.7); EDW 3520620 starts here too; confidence: high; pdf_page: 203; quote: goes northwest 0.7 mile to a level side road going north</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.359140" lon="-121.574380"><ele>1033.9</ele><name>Sharp bend and culvert on Road 620</name><desc>source: OSM node 3686403992, the bend where 620 turns from NE to NW, 1.21 mi from 3520 (book 0.5 + 0.7 = 1.2); USGS topo has Robinhood Creek reaching the road here; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 203; quote: continue on the road for another 0.7 mile ... The road makes a sharp bend and crosses a culvert, and this is where you ski off the road westward</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.358200" lon="-121.580000"><ele>1046.8</ele><name>North end of Horsethief Meadows</name><desc>source: placed from the text and sketch (meadows west of 620, at the foot of Bluegrass Ridge, west of Robinhood Creek); imagery today shows closed forest here, no open meadow; confidence: low; pdf_page: 203; quote: ski off the road westward through a band of trees to the northern end of Horsethief Meadows</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Horsethief Meadows</name><desc>1. Turnout on Highway 35 near Robinhood Campground -&gt; Highway 35 / Road 3520 junction: osm (high), 0.13 mi | 2. Highway 35 / Road 3520 junction -&gt; Road 3520 / Road 620 junction: osm (high), 0.73 mi | 3. Road 3520 / Road 620 junction -&gt; Sharp bend and culvert on Road 620: osm (high), 1.22 mi | 4. Sharp bend and culvert on Road 620 -&gt; North end of Horsethief Meadows: straight (low), 0.28 mi</desc>
